tle they lose their  shine and break very easily upon  minimal plucking you can also experience  low grade fever  more severe forms are presented with pus  coming out  and permanent bald spots and scarring  which is stressful  both mentally and aesthetically  the diagnosis is made by examining those  spots  on a scalp under uv woods lamp  your doctor can also take samples of  your hair to examine them under the  microscope  and some of the samples from the skin of  scalp to confirm the diagnosis  now let's look at another superficial  fungal infection known as tiniacroris  which is very very common the word kura  signifies legs  but the infection that we are going to  talk about does not occur on the legs  but in between the legs that is the  groin area  it affects the skin of the genitals  inner thighs  and sometimes buttocks this condition is  known as jock itch  this condition is common in people who  wear tight clothing  tight clothing traps moisture and favors  the growth of this fungus  symptoms of tinea crew race include  severe itching in the groin area  the area becomes red and often a  ring-shaped rash develops in the area  we will look at other types of teenia  like tinia angum and tina barbe in  separate videos  so make sure to subscribe to mad  simplified and hit the bell icon  so you don't miss out on those videos  now we will look at the treatment part  of these  tenure infections especially the tinia  pedis tina cruris antinea corporis  because fungi thrive in moist warm  environments  patients should be encouraged to wear  loose fitting garments made of cotton or  synthetic materials  designed to wick moisture away from the  surface  socks should also have similar  properties  areas likely to become infected should  be dried completely  covering with clothes patients should be  advised to  avoid walking barefoot and sharing  garments  if we look at the treatment itself it  can be divided into topical antifungals  which are applied over the skin and 